st","title":"Photography and Royal Portraits","body":"Ryan Adams has developed his love for photography into a serious pursuit, even taking portraits of the Queen. \"Ryan Adams has turned his love of photography into something that even had him take portraits of the queen.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Hobbies of Musicians","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xc85sLj0Cnk"}]}],"awards":[{"kind":"award","title":"Shortlist Music Prize (2001) — Heartbreaker","body":"Nominated.","year":2001,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Wikidata","episode":null,"url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q7502207"}]}],"concerts":[],"xref":[{"kind":"xref","title":"Extensive Musician Dating History","body":"Winona Ryder, an actress, has been connected to or dated a significant number of musicians, totaling 22 individuals according to a count from the transcript. Her relationships included Dave Grohl, Ryan Adams, Pete Yorn, Jack White, Julian from The Strokes, Conor Oberst of Bright Eyes, possibly Jeff Tweedy from Wilco, Irish musician Damien Rice, Tre Cool of Green Day, Marky Walberg (Marky Mark), Stephen Jenkins of Third Eye Blind, Everlast (whose real name is Eric Shorty), John Kay from Jamiroquai, Adam Duritz of Counting Crows (who also dated Jennifer Aniston and Courtney Cox), Chris Isaak, Dave Pirner of Soul Asylum, Paul Westerberg of The Replacements (which was noted as potentially during her \"Minneapolis punk period\"), Mike Nesmith of The Monkees, Johnny Depp, and Evan Dando of The Lemonheads. The last heard connection was an engagement to Blake Sennett, who plays guitar in Rilo Kiley. \"I count 22 musicians.\"","year":null,"extra":{"from":"Winona Ryder","from_id":66715850215106,"type":"curiosity"},"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Listener Email","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yl2poVWguu0"}]},{"kind":"xref","title":"Feud with Ryan Adams over Song Covers","body":"In 2002, Jack White publicly attacked Ryan Adams in the press for covering several White Stripes songs and changing some of their lyrics. The dispute continued for a while before Adams offered positive remarks about The White Stripes, and the conflict faded. \"2002, Ryan Adams covers several white striped songs but changed some of the lyrics. Jack attacked Adams and depressed for this.\"","year":null,"extra":{"from":"The White Stripes","from_id":155958066408609,"type":"curiosity"},"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Modern Rock Feuds","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zUr9sjWgUcw"}]}],"charts":[{"id":220959612847523,"type":"album","name":"Heartbreaker","work_year":2000,"list_id":192934750972716,"list":"1001 Albums You Must Hear Before You Die","src":"charts","rank":904,"year":2000,"note":null,"yt":"-Z0o7zWtu_0","scaruffi":null},{"id":220959612847523,"type":"album","name":"Heartbreaker","list_id":118798969175346,"list":"RYM Top — Country — Alt-Country","src":"musthear","rank":101,"year":2000,"note":null,"yt":"-Z0o7zWtu_0","scaruffi":null},{"id":220959612847523,"type":"album","name":"Heartbreaker","list_id":103254340346721,"list":"RYM Top — Regional Music — Americana","src":"musthear","rank":95,"year":2000,"note":null,"yt":"-Z0o7zWtu_0","scaruffi":null},{"id":220959612847523,"type":"album","name":"Heartbreaker","work_year":2000,"list_id":44456762010629,"list":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 2000","src":"charts","rank":47,"year":2000,"note":null,"yt":"-Z0o7zWtu_0","scaruffi":null},{"id":105693061614086,"type":"album","name":"Gold","work_year":2001,"list_id":192934750972716,"list":"1001 Albums You Must Hear Before You Die","src":"charts","rank":933,"year":2001,"note":null,"yt":"HZ3qMfSvP0A","scaruffi":null},{"id":110420268258658,"type":"album","name":"Love is Hell","list_id":187245616636746,"list":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 2004","src":"musthear","rank":152,"year":2004,"note":null,"yt":"c3hE3vC9BN4","scaruffi":null},{"id":171279067204848,"type":"album","name":"Pris